# Repo boundaries (benchmarks)

This repo is **wall-clock performance matrix + dashboard only**.

## Owns

- `catalog.toml`, `scripts/ingest/`, `data/latest/summary.json`
- `dashboard-next/` perf UI (pillars, matrix, bench detail)
- Sidecars: `benchmark-matrix.json`, `release-index.json`

## Never add here

- Proof corpus UI, voting board, `library.json`, `posture.json` → **proof-library**
- `proof-db/`, TOML catalog entries, Lean bridge → **lic**
- Full **lic**/**lis** checkouts or build trees under `data/` → use CI sibling checkout or gitignored `data/workspaces/` only for ephemeral agent runs

## Cross-repo links

- `/proofs` is a **redirect stub** to https://li-langverse.github.io/proof-library/
- Nav may link externally; do not re-import proof-library components or ingest scripts

## When ingest needs lic data

Read sibling `lic` at build time via `LIC_ROOT` in CI — do not vendor or duplicate lic sources into this repo.
